## Hard stop conditions

- A style-pack identity/version mismatch.
- A contradiction that cannot be resolved from durable canon.
- A required chapter, record, changes JSON, or memory writeback cannot be completed atomically.
- The next chapter would require changing the approved central arc, ending, or explicit user constraint.
- Repeated quality-gate failure after one focused rewrite.
- Reader-experience center drift or a hard quantitative bound failure after one focused rewrite/replan.

